{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00183","headline":"延英殿玉灵芝诗三章章八句 三 · 肃宗皇帝","name":"延英殿玉灵芝诗三章章八句 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"幸生芳本，当我扆旒。\n效此灵质，贲其王猷。\n神惟不爱，道亦无求。\n端拱思惟，永荷天休。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"肃宗皇帝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00183.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00183","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}